.
.  Generate sample output for Cauchy PPF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na cauppf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Cauchy PPF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
X1LABEL Probability
Y1LABEL X
.
PLOT CAUPPF(P) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp CAUPPF.PS cauppf.ps
system rm CAUPPF.PS
.
quit
